move toward NT support of applications.  I know that the ZLX cards are 
supported on both VMS and NT, but both the 2M and 4M versions are expensive.
(I should note for people, that if your application requires fast video,
the ZLX cards can't be touched by the cheaper cards by Matrox, #9, ATI etc.)
