1280x1024x(8 or 24 bit) are supported under VMS or under NT but not both.

I have been told by one Alpha clone maker that the 4M #9 GXE is supported 
under both VMS and NT, and by another that it is not supported.

Calling #9, ATI etc. gets you a run around, like what's an Alpha, or VMS,
and usually a no we don't, primarily because DEC might have wrote the
driver, so the video card people are generally clueless.

