It would help to know what kind of system to which you want to hook the RZ56.
The biggest problem you may have is getting it to spinup on powerup instead
of the spinup on command which is how it would have been configured for use
with a Digital non-PC system.  How to change this depends on what system(s)
you have available.  For MS-DOS PCs, check ftp.pc.digital.com for the
rzspinup program if you have an Adaptec 154x/174x adapter.  For Macs, there
are SCSI utilities which can change the Digital mode page bit.

