It's almost certain that in some cases, the problem was that folks simply
hadn't installed the new PAKs (through last year, the CSLG PAKs expired in June
or thereabouts; for some reason, DEC changed that to put the expiration dates
on February 28 this year, then issued PAKs which are due to expire again on
