Daniel M Drucker (dmd@asimov.oit.umass.edu) wrote:

: Is it possible to boot a VS 2000 from a dumb terminal?

: How would I go about doing this?

: Also, is anyone interested in buying a VS 2000 in unknown condition? :)

Yes, but you need a specially adapted serial cable connected to the
printer port.  DEC calls it a BCC05 Console Cable.  It looks just
like a BCC09 Printer Cable, except for the markings.  It shorts two
pins (I think 8 and 9) which causes the VS2000 to bring up the
console on the Printer Port at 9600 baud.

Barry Kort



